      "writtenOn": "2023-03-17T23:41:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A dm-verity work item doesn\u0027t use that much CPU time. I\u0027d expect WQ_CPU_INTENSIVE to have no impact with accelerated algorithms.\n\nIIUC WQ_CPU_INTENSIVE is to take workers with long running jobs out of the worker pool management and have them only managed by the scheduler. Since a dm-verity work is so short, removing the worker from the worker pool doesn\u0027t seem useful. I don\u0027t think that flag should have been enabled in the first place.",
